{"id": 1052, "title": "The birthdays of children", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "the-birthdays-of-children", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1052_the-birthdays-of-children.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我和我的好朋友都有孩子，我有一个女儿，她有一个儿子。我的女儿在2017年2月16日星期四出生。朋友的儿子生日是6月30日。他的生日快到了，不知道他想要什么礼物呢？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我和我的好朋友都有孩子，我有一個女兒，她有一個兒子。我的女兒在2017年2月16日星期四出生。朋友的兒子生日是6月30日。他的生日快到了，不知道他想要什麼禮物呢？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ hé wǒ de hǎo péng you dōu yǒu hái zi， wǒ yǒu yī gè nǚ ér， tā yǒu yī gè ér zi。 wǒ de nǚ ér zài 2017 nián 2 yuè 16 rì Xīng qī sì chū shēng。 péng you de ér zi shēng rì shì 6 yuè 30 rì。 tā de shēng rì kuài dào le， bù zhī dào tā xiǎng yào shén me lǐ wù ne？"], "english_paragraphs": ["My good friend and I both have children. I have a daughter, and she has a son. My daughter was born on Thursday, February 16, 2017. My friend’s son’s birthday is June 30. His birthday is coming up soon. I wonder what gift he would like?"], "english_full": "My good friend and I both have children. I have a daughter, and she has a son. My daughter was born on Thursday, February 16, 2017. My friend’s son’s birthday is June 30. His birthday is coming up soon. I wonder what gift he would like?", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"(of two people) close; on intimate terms\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK